        "7": {
            "type": "markdown",
            "content": "### AI Observability - Understanding and governing your AI\n\nAs AI systems become integral to business operations across Australia, organisations face increasing challenges in understanding and governing these complex technologies. AI Observability provides essential visibility into model behaviour, performance metrics, and decision-making processes that would otherwise remain opaque. Without proper monitoring, businesses risk operational failures, compliance issues, escalating costs, and difficulty troubleshooting when AI systems produce unexpected results. By implementing comprehensive observability practices, organisations can ensure their AI investments deliver reliable, transparent, and cost-effective outcomes whilst meeting regulatory requirements and maintaining stakeholder trust.\n\n[Get started in minutes! Check out how to ingest data.](https://docs.dynatrace.com/docs/shortlink/ai-ml-get-started)"
        },
        "8": {
            "title": "",
            "type": "data",
            "query": "fetch logs\n| filter isNotNull(data.data.model)\n| summarize \n    {inputTokensPerTrace   = sum(coalesce(toLong(data.data.usage.input_tokens), 0)),\n    outputTokensPerTrace  = sum(coalesce(toLong(data.data.usage.output_tokens), 0)),\n    maxChatTurnPerTrace   = max(coalesce(toLong(data.data.chat_turn), 0))}\n  , by: { trace_id }\n| fieldsAdd\n    costPerTraceUSD = (inputTokensPerTrace  / 1000000.0) * 0.80\n                  + (outputTokensPerTrace / 1000000.0) * 4.00\n| filter maxChatTurnPerTrace >= 0\n| summarize avgCostPerChatTurn = round(avg(costPerTraceUSD / maxChatTurnPerTrace), decimals: 4)\n| fieldsKeep avgCostPerChatTurn",
            "visualization": "singleValue",
            "visualizationSettings": {
                "singleValue": {
                    "label": "$USD avg Turn Cost",
                    "isIconVisible": true
                },
                "autoSelectVisualization": false,
                "thresholds": [
                    {
                        "id": 1,
                        "field": "avgCostPerChatTurn",
                        "title": "",
                        "isEnabled": true,
                        "rules": [
                            {
                                "id": 0,
                                "color": {
                                    "Default": "var(--dt-colors-charts-status-ideal-default, #2f6862)"
                                },
                                "comparator": "≥",
                                "label": "",
                                "value": 0.03
                            },
                            {
                                "id": 1,
                                "color": {
                                    "Default": "var(--dt-colors-charts-status-warning-default, #eea53c)"
                                },
                                "comparator": "≥",
                                "label": "",
                                "value": 0.04
                            },
                            {
                                "id": 2,
                                "color": {
                                    "Default": "var(--dt-colors-charts-status-critical-default, #c62239)"
                                },
                                "comparator": "≥",
                                "label": "",
                                "value": 0.05
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            },
            "querySettings": {
                "maxResultRecords": 1000,
                "defaultScanLimitGbytes": 500,
                "maxResultMegaBytes": 1,
                "defaultSamplingRatio": 10,
                "enableSampling": false
            },
            "davis": {
                "enabled": false,
                "davisVisualization": {
                    "isAvailable": true
                }
            }
